                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The UN and its entities work directly against U.S. interests.\n\nThe UN Secretary-General will release his report on Children & Armed Conflict where he has placed our ally, Israel, in the same category as Al Qaeda, Boko Haram, al-Shabaab, and Hezbollah regarding the treatment of children. The Secretary-General and his UN could not be more divorced from reality if they had asked Hamas to ghostwrite this report on their behalf.\n\nHamas, with the help of UNRWA, has been using children as human shields and brainwashing them into its death cult for years.\n\nNO FUNDING FOR THE UN. They do not merit our support.",
